  facilities. Only studies reporting that all participants received the index test and the reference standard and       
  presenting 2 x 2 data were eligible for inclusion. We excluded diagnostic case‐control studies."""                    
                                                                                                                        
  # Call gatekeeper with the correct argument name                                                                      
